OL,3,CFirefighters tackle large fire at
OL,4,Crecycling centre
OL,6,FFirefighters have been tackling a huge
OL,7,Ffire at a recycling centre in Corby
OL,8,Fovernight.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Fire and Rescue
OL,11,FService said over 500 tonnes of
OL,12,Frecycling waste was on fire yesterday
OL,13,Fevening (Monday 10 August)
OL,15,FFirefighters were called to Earlstrees
OL,16,Festate at around 2pm, with 10 fire
OL,17,Fengines at the scene at its height.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/3
