OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786470510
OL,3,CFirefighters tackle large fire at
OL,4,Crecycling centre
OL,6,FFour fire engines are continuing to
OL,7,Fwork to extinguish the blaze this
OL,8,Fmorning, which has spread to some
OL,9,Fshipping containers at a neighbouring
OL,10,Fcommercial site.
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire Fire and Rescue
OL,13,FService said in a statement at 7am
OL,14,Fthis morning: "There is still a
OL,15,Fsignificant amount of smoke issuing
OL,16,Ffrom the site, so residents and nearby
OL,17,Fbusinesses are urged to keep their
OL,18,Fwindows and doors closed for the time
OL,19,Fbeing.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/3
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786470510
OL,3,CFirefighters tackle large fire at
OL,4,Crecycling centre
OL,6,F"Gretton Brook Road continues to be
OL,7,Fclosed this morning, and we anticipate
OL,8,Fwe will be firefighting for some
OL,9,Fconsiderable time today.
OL,11,F"We appreciate the impact this will
OL,12,Fhave on local businesses and residents
OL,13,Fand would like to thank them for their
OL,14,Fpatience as we continue to prevent
OL,15,Fthis fire from spreading further.
OL,17,F"At this stage, it is still too early
OL,18,Fto confirm what the cause of the fire
OL,19,Fwas, but an investigation will take
OL,20,Fplace as soon as it is safe to do so."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/3
